      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DIRTY LULU (1) jumped from the squeeze on debut and ran an eye catching race, finishing third at Shepparton over 390m (22.83). Boxed the fence this time. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. HALLELUJAH HOUND (2) is a first starter by Beast Unleashed out of Sandave Rebel with no trial form to work with. Profiles nicely but market best guide to ability. BAO BUN (5) is yet to break through in eight starts but has run a number of placings. Was below best last time when missed the frame finishing sixth (20.91) at this track. The form from her last run stacks up well. Has ability and is one of the better chances. BLACK BOSS (7) is by Shima Shine out of My Catalina making debut. Start all important and will need some luck getting across from the wide draw. Can run a bold race on debut.",
